#: data/maps/FortreeCity_DecorationShop/scripts.inc:56
msgctxt "FortreeCity_DecorationShop_Text_MerchandiseSentToPC"
msgid ""
"Merchandise you buy here is sent to\n"
"your own PC.\p"
"That's fantastic! I wish they could\n"
"also deliver me home like that.$"
msgstr ""
"在这里买的商品会送到你自己的电脑里。\p"
"真是太厉害了！\n"
"真希望他们也能像这样把我送回家。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_DecorationShop/scripts.inc:62
msgctxt "FortreeCity_DecorationShop_Text_BuyingDeskForDolls"
msgid ""
"I'm buying a pretty desk and I'm\n"
"putting my cute DOLLS on it.\p"
"If I don't, when I decorate my\n"
"SECRET BASE, my DOLLS will get\l"
"dirty or poked with splinters.$"
msgstr ""
"我要买一张漂亮的桌子，\n"
"把我可爱的玩偶都摆在上面。\p"
"不然我布置秘密基地的时候，\n"
"玩偶会弄脏，或者被木刺扎到。$"
